+ * Size of one entry in Dav1dPicture.blk_data, in bytes.
+ *
+ * blk_data is an array of the internal Av1Block struct, so a consumer has to know its layout to
+ * index it - and indexing it with the wrong size silently yields garbage for every block rather
+ * than failing. Compare this against the sizeof of your own copy of the struct before reading
+ * blk_data, and do not read it if they differ.
+ *
+ * Returns 0 if this build cannot export block data at all.
+ */
